            id="b9407bbc-98fa-4479-bdf4-7d82b519bcd8" name="Prepare a serving of hot coffee on demand"
            description="Need served: a cup when wanted, without preparing more than needed. Drivers: convenience. Draft: NOTE-0002 revision 2, capability 1.">
