            description="Need served: go from box or storage to a first cup quickly (first use and after storage). Drivers: convenience. Draft: NOTE-0002 revision 2, capability 6.">
          <ownedEntityOperationalCapabilityInvolvements xsi:type="org.polarsys.capella.core.data.oa:EntityOperationalCapabilityInvolvement"
