            id="91dacebd-278e-4d6e-b810-21ef965ceeb4" name="Store, move, and obtain support or replacement parts"
            description="Need served: the whole ownership lifetime. Drivers: convenience. May combine with capability 10 when tuning. Draft: NOTE-0002 revision 2, capability 12.">
